          "We publish the spread, not only the average, because a median can hide a long tail of untouched files. Open counts and the oldest file by owner show where delay collects. A finding without an owner or a next step is not ready for the pipeline meeting. The result is written in ordinary language, with technical detail kept in an appendix."
